From: Oliphaunt Maintainers <dev@oliphaunt.dev>
Date: Mon, 7 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 6/7] libc: query process resource limits through WASIX

Expose proc_rlimit_get in the public ABI and import implementation so libc can
report the host-selected stack limit rather than a fabricated constant. Update
expected symbol inventories across supported libc variants with the same ABI.
Requires the host resource-limit syscall in the Wasmer process patch.

Extracted without runtime hunk changes from the inherited integration bundle.
The complete ordered series is the build and qualification unit.

